        type: "p",
        text: "Then there is the growing curiosity around Peruvian cuisine, with dishes such as *ceviche* playing the role of international ambassador for the South American country. **Indeed, Peru has become one of the world’s most exciting gastronomic destinations, celebrated for its extraordinary biodiversity and combination of indigenous Asian, European, and African influences**. India has a natural affinity with this cuisine since both traditions understand acidity, chillis, herbs, and strong seasoning.",
