        type: "p",
        text: "Universal trends succeed best when they satisfy an existing local need. It makes for an exciting opportunity for Indian chefs, who, instead of inquiring, “How do I reproduce what is popular abroad?” should ask, “What can I learn from it, and what can I create with it?”",
