    author: "Asiya Farshana",
    role: "Cabin Crew",
    date: "August 2026",
    excerpt: "In our series, we travel to various Indian destinations with a SpiceJet family member. This time, Asiya takes us around her home, Wayanad.",
    heroImage: "/images/stories/my-hometown-wayanad.webp",
    heroImageAlt: "Misty green hills and trees under a cloudy sky",
    heroImageSource: "Spice Route - August 2026, PDF page 74",
