    category: "travel",
    author: "Ayushi Anand",
    date: "July 2026",
    excerpt: "Pune is not a city that reveals itself in a hurry. It’s best experienced slowly, one cup of coffee, one heritage landmark, and one memorable meal at a time. Maharashtra’s cultural capital blends old-world charm with youthful energy and a thriving food scene, all topped off with a vibe that’s inimitably Pune.",
    heroImage: "/images/stories/day-in-a-city-pune.webp",
    heroImageAlt: "A road winding through green hills above a lake",
    heroImageSource: "Spice Route - July 2026, PDF pages 42–43",
