        type: "p",
        text: "“Nowadays, men are becoming much more conscious about their appearance and overall grooming. We actually see a higher number of male clients, especially for skin-brightening and skin-rejuvenation treatments. Currently, we are seeing a significant increase in men seeking aesthetic treatments for both skin and hair concerns. Among the most popular procedures are laser resurfacing treatments for the face and exosome therapy for hair restoration,” says Dr Jung, adding, “Many male patients primarily aim to improve skin texture, reduce tanning and uneven skin tone, and achieve a healthier, brighter complexion.”",
